WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.837
IMG to kick off
to Bishop Sycamore.

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.256
Do you want my hands
like this,

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.466
like this, like that?

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:08.675
Just be natural.
You don't have to try.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.010
Coach Roy Johnson
told us

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.179
they had a number of
division one prospects.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:16.391
New high. Tip. Intercepted!

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.560
Thanks to the pick six.
Into the end zone.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.521
He'll waltz in.
And that will do it.

00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:24.566
Do I look like a con artist?

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:28.112
How this happens

00:00:28.112 --> 00:00:29.696
got a lot of people
scratching their head.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.366
Bishop Sycamore is not even
a real high school.

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:35.786
They did not have teachers.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:37.788
We really was pretty much
on our own.

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:39.790
We didn't have
any trainers.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:40.874
People were sharing
helmets.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.543
It was disgusting.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.795
I was literally
sick to my stomach.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.839
I can't believe
this happened again.

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.508
My philosophy
of business is,

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:51.885
do what the people
who have the money do,

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.137
even if you
don't have the money.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.222
Roy will tell you
he's a liar.

00:00:55.931 --> 00:00:57.474
He knew what to say,
how to say it.

00:00:58.517 --> 00:01:00.769
He's like, "Aw, man,
you gotta let that go."

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.521
I said, "I'mma tell you what
I'm gonna let go.

00:01:02.521 --> 00:01:04.565
I'm gonna let go of his neck
after I grab it."

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:07.818
I think I'm the most honest
liar that I know.

00:01:08.652 --> 00:01:10.195
How can you coach kids,

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:12.489
and you know
it's not a school?

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.283
Roy would tell people,

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:15.159
"You're gonna be playing
at Alabama."

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.869
He would just sell them
their dream.

00:01:17.661 --> 00:01:20.038
Ohio was embarrassed
by this.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.623
They called the thing
explicitly a scam.

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:26.712
And then said they couldn't
do a damn thing about it.

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:29.131
Bishop Sycamore
does not happen

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:30.841
if there wasn't an abundance

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:32.634
of money
in high school sports.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:34.052
Let's go!

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:36.889
Did I break a law?
Is it illegal? Am I in jail?

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.184
We're on ESPN.
Win, lose, or draw, we win.

00:01:41.769 --> 00:01:43.812
This is not what
we was supposed to create.

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:45.939
How do I tell my mama
that coach wants me to do

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:46.982
the same stuff
that you tried

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:47.858
to get me away from?

00:01:48.192 --> 00:01:50.360
You say you care about us,
but did you really?

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.321
Can we take a break?

00:01:52.321 --> 00:01:53.489
That's some bull--

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.410
-One! Two! Three!
-Hard work!

